WEBVTT

01:42.009 --> 01:48.990
[Genius Girlfriend]

01:49.490 --> 01:51.950
[Episode 15]

01:53.780 --> 01:57.720
[Class Meeting]

01:54.120 --> 01:55.590
The winter break is from January 20th

01:55.590 --> 01:56.590
to February 28th,

01:56.590 --> 01:57.479
40 days in total.

01:57.479 --> 01:59.070
Every teacher has assigned homework.

01:57.810 --> 02:00.120
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

01:59.070 --> 01:59.950
Write it down.

02:00.200 --> 02:02.420
For math, 1 workbook
and 10 mock papers.

02:02.710 --> 02:03.590
Oh my gosh.

02:03.590 --> 02:05.120
For Chinese, 10 essays,

02:04.360 --> 02:06.160
[Class Meeting]

02:05.120 --> 02:06.430
10 classical Chinese texts
you must memorize,

02:06.430 --> 02:07.510
and reading notes.

02:07.590 --> 02:08.400
For English,

02:08.680 --> 02:10.750
memorize all the vocabulary lists
for the next semester.

02:10.750 --> 02:11.680
And for science...

02:11.510 --> 02:12.900
[Pursue Knowledge, Seek Truth;
Practice Diligently, Foster Innovation]

02:14.080 --> 02:15.310
Let me remind you,

02:15.430 --> 02:16.590
even though you're only in grade 10,

02:16.400 --> 02:18.720
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:16.590 --> 02:18.590
high school life goes by in a flash.

02:18.960 --> 02:20.560
Even though we are
in the experimental class,

02:20.560 --> 02:22.079
if you let your guard down
even a little bit,

02:22.079 --> 02:23.680
you'll be the one left behind.

02:23.680 --> 02:24.630
So, class,

02:24.630 --> 02:26.150
cherish this winter break.

02:26.150 --> 02:27.430
Because when you come back
for the new semester,

02:27.430 --> 02:28.750
you will never have

02:28.750 --> 02:30.400
such relaxing days again.

02:30.560 --> 02:31.710
Alright, that's all I have to say.

02:31.710 --> 02:33.040
Be safe on your way home.

02:33.050 --> 02:34.490
[Constantly Strive to Become Stronger;
Strive to Be Number One]

02:33.120 --> 02:34.710
Happy New Year in advance.

02:51.430 --> 02:52.490
What are your plans

02:52.560 --> 02:54.090
for the winter break, guys?

02:54.840 --> 02:56.440
I have no plans. I'm on break.

02:57.590 --> 02:59.050
But the lab isn't on break,

02:59.150 --> 03:00.880
so there's still no one at home.

03:01.840 --> 03:04.520
I'm traveling abroad
with my parents this year.

03:06.680 --> 03:07.960
That's nice.

03:11.150 --> 03:13.750
I'll stay home, read books,
and watch the shop.

03:14.190 --> 03:15.870
That's a bit boring.

03:16.150 --> 03:17.350
What about you, Tang?

03:18.310 --> 03:19.120
Tang?

03:22.190 --> 03:23.000
Tang?

03:24.190 --> 03:25.800
What are you doing for winter break?

03:25.800 --> 03:27.150
I don't have any plans.

03:34.150 --> 03:35.240
I have an idea.

03:36.079 --> 03:37.710
Since we have so much
winter break homework,

03:37.710 --> 03:40.590
why don't we get the hard part
out of the way first?

03:41.190 --> 03:42.630
Let's spend 5 days

03:42.750 --> 03:44.470
working together

03:44.560 --> 03:45.520
to finish all the homework

03:45.520 --> 03:47.590
within these 5 days.

03:48.190 --> 03:49.960
For the rest of the break,
we can just relax

03:49.960 --> 03:51.190
and have a great time.

03:51.430 --> 03:52.430
Wouldn't that be exciting?

03:52.430 --> 03:53.800
Wouldn't that be awesome?

03:53.800 --> 03:55.260
What do you say? Are you in?

04:02.560 --> 04:03.280
Zhixia.

04:04.840 --> 04:05.560
Are you in?

04:11.960 --> 04:12.520
Sure.

04:14.150 --> 04:16.149
What about you guys? Say something.

04:16.720 --> 04:17.560
I'm in.

04:18.040 --> 04:18.720
Sure.

04:23.800 --> 04:24.920
I won't join you.

04:25.310 --> 04:26.560
I've already planned

04:26.560 --> 04:28.510
my daily study schedule
based on the holidays.

04:28.510 --> 04:30.630
If I finish all my homework today,

04:31.120 --> 04:32.000
I don't know what other tutoring classes

04:32.000 --> 04:33.659
my parents will sign me up for.

04:35.560 --> 04:36.360
I understand.

04:36.830 --> 04:38.090
I totally understand.

04:40.390 --> 04:41.190
Tang,

04:41.360 --> 04:42.360
you can just tag along and benefit.

04:42.360 --> 04:43.480
You definitely have to join.

04:43.480 --> 04:45.190
If you have any questions you don't know,

04:45.190 --> 04:47.480
all these experts will help you out.

04:47.480 --> 04:48.720
It'll be great.

04:50.240 --> 04:52.570
Let's just treat it as studying together.

04:54.120 --> 04:55.630
Okay, then it's settled.

06:05.190 --> 06:05.830
Tang.

06:07.040 --> 06:07.840
What's wrong?

06:18.600 --> 06:20.260
I really can't write anymore.

06:20.360 --> 06:21.560
I'm going home first.

06:22.390 --> 06:23.390
You guys go ahead.

06:41.920 --> 06:43.520
What's wrong with Tingting?

06:46.560 --> 06:48.760
She didn't do well on the exam this time.

06:50.159 --> 06:51.120
Doesn't our school

06:51.120 --> 06:52.720
require you to change classes
if the sum of your 2 total scores

06:52.720 --> 06:54.800
drops out of the top 50 in the grade?

06:55.190 --> 06:57.510
She ranked 49th
in the grade the first time,

06:57.510 --> 06:58.830
and 53rd this time.

06:58.830 --> 07:00.190
So she is at great risk.

07:01.920 --> 07:02.560
Well,

07:02.870 --> 07:05.000
the final ranking of the 2 total scores

07:05.000 --> 07:06.430
also depends on other students.

07:06.430 --> 07:08.680
You can't just compare her scores alone.

07:08.680 --> 07:09.720
So,

07:10.120 --> 07:11.680
Tang Tingting's fate

07:11.680 --> 07:13.510
is no longer in her own hands.

07:13.510 --> 07:14.970
How can she not be anxious?

07:19.480 --> 07:20.360
If you ask me,

07:20.950 --> 07:22.550
there is only one way out now.

07:25.870 --> 07:27.360
God, have mercy.

07:29.480 --> 07:30.740
Let's not mention this

07:30.870 --> 07:32.070
in front of her.

07:46.870 --> 07:48.240
I'm back, Mom.

07:49.360 --> 07:50.560
Zhixia, you're back.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.050
My daughter is back.

07:53.120 --> 07:54.070
Zhixia, come here.

07:54.070 --> 07:55.390
Look who are here.

07:57.430 --> 07:59.030
Your uncle and aunt are here.

07:59.159 --> 08:00.390
Hello, Uncle. Hello, Aunt.

08:00.390 --> 08:01.240
Hello.

08:02.240 --> 08:03.040
Have a seat.

08:06.310 --> 08:07.000
Zhixia,

08:07.600 --> 08:09.070
we haven't seen each other for years.

08:09.070 --> 08:10.600
She's getting prettier.

08:11.830 --> 08:13.480
Have your studies
been tiring you out lately?

08:13.480 --> 08:14.240
Not really.

08:16.160 --> 08:17.920
Zhuangzhuang, don't you recognize
your sister Zhixia?

08:17.920 --> 08:20.850
You two used to play together
a lot when you were kids.

08:23.510 --> 08:24.270
Zhixia.

08:24.420 --> 08:27.680
Your uncle said you've loved snacks
since you were little.

08:27.680 --> 08:29.390
Here, take this bag of snacks
back to your room

08:29.390 --> 08:30.430
and share them with your brother.

08:30.430 --> 08:31.360
Oh, you.

08:31.380 --> 08:33.789
We have all kinds of snacks
in our supermarket.

08:33.789 --> 08:35.169
Why are you being so polite?

08:35.169 --> 08:37.289
We have them in the store. Really.

08:37.549 --> 08:38.240
Sister,

08:38.549 --> 08:39.960
how is the business at your supermarket?

08:39.960 --> 08:41.020
Is it making money?

08:41.059 --> 08:43.480
Not bad. It's enough to get by.

08:44.550 --> 08:45.440
If you ask me,

08:45.440 --> 08:47.200
relying entirely
on a supermarket for a living

08:47.200 --> 08:48.800
is not a long-term solution.

08:49.130 --> 08:51.600
You just haven't reached
the point where you need money.

08:51.600 --> 08:52.720
Think about it.

08:53.000 --> 08:55.240
These two kids
will be going to college soon.

08:55.240 --> 08:57.390
After they graduate,
they'll need to find jobs

08:57.390 --> 08:58.450
and find a partner.

08:58.510 --> 09:00.030
And Zeqiu is a boy.

09:00.120 --> 09:02.360
You'll have plenty of expenses
in the future.

09:02.360 --> 09:03.710
Exactly.

09:03.730 --> 09:05.840
Everything costs money nowadays.

09:07.120 --> 09:08.320
Our generation

09:08.440 --> 09:09.840
is destined to work hard.

09:10.270 --> 09:12.440
We work so hard to earn this money,

09:12.960 --> 09:15.360
isn't it all just to provide
for our family?

09:15.720 --> 09:16.320
Yes.

09:16.320 --> 09:19.320
Just a few days ago,
we went back to our parents' house.

09:19.790 --> 09:20.870
That house

09:21.440 --> 09:23.000
is really unlivable now.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.060
The roof leaks,

09:24.200 --> 09:25.080
and it smells.

09:26.270 --> 09:27.600
We immediately decided

09:27.960 --> 09:28.820
to renovate it.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.910
Then let's make it clear.

09:34.930 --> 09:36.480
However much the renovation costs,

09:36.480 --> 09:37.870
make a list later,

09:37.870 --> 09:38.840
we'll calculate it

09:38.840 --> 09:40.030
and split it half-half.

09:40.030 --> 09:41.830
Sis, why are you telling me this?

09:41.870 --> 09:42.550
Seriously.

09:42.750 --> 09:43.870
That won't do.

09:43.960 --> 09:45.600
As their children,

09:45.600 --> 09:47.390
there's no need to fuss over
who pays more.

09:47.390 --> 09:47.770
That won't do.

09:47.770 --> 09:49.120
We are family, you...

09:49.120 --> 09:50.600
But we still need to be clear about this.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.440
Okay.

09:51.870 --> 09:53.470
We can talk about this later.

09:53.720 --> 09:55.440
Here's my plan for this year.

09:55.720 --> 09:57.510
Since we are going to renovate that house

09:57.510 --> 09:58.510
in a few days,

09:58.510 --> 09:59.910
I want to bring Mom and Dad over

09:59.910 --> 10:01.360
to stay with us for a while.

10:01.360 --> 10:02.870
They can spend the New Year
at my place this year.

10:02.870 --> 10:04.510
My house is big, you see.

10:04.510 --> 10:05.910
You guys can all come over later,

10:05.910 --> 10:08.310
and we'll celebrate the New Year together.

10:08.720 --> 10:09.510
Sure.

10:09.720 --> 10:11.980
Then I'll go there early
on New Year's Eve

10:12.150 --> 10:13.670
and help you guys out.

10:14.120 --> 10:16.000
Why must we wait for the 30th day?

10:16.230 --> 10:17.720
Just go back with us later.

10:17.740 --> 10:19.200
That won't do.

10:19.240 --> 10:21.390
The supermarket needs manpower
during the New Year.

10:21.390 --> 10:24.650
Your brother-in-law and I
will be busy at the supermarket.

10:25.870 --> 10:27.070
Then, how about this?

10:27.440 --> 10:30.030
Let Zhixia and Zeqiu
go back with me first.

10:30.870 --> 10:32.150
I just bought a new computer.

10:32.150 --> 10:34.120
You two can take this chance to relax.

10:34.120 --> 10:35.200
It's a holiday after all.

10:35.200 --> 10:37.360
You can't just study
at home every day, right?

10:37.360 --> 10:38.440
No need, Uncle.

10:38.950 --> 10:41.000
We'll just stay at our own place.

10:41.150 --> 10:43.680
We have a lot of homework,
and it's quiet here.

10:43.870 --> 10:44.630
That's fine.

10:44.630 --> 10:46.030
We have a lot of rooms.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.790
I'll tidy up the biggest one

10:47.790 --> 10:49.630
just for the 3 of you to study in.

10:49.670 --> 10:50.480
That's right.

10:50.600 --> 10:51.860
By then, the 3 of you...

10:52.390 --> 10:54.850
Goodness,
can you stop playing for a moment?

10:58.950 --> 11:00.030
My kid is good

11:00.030 --> 11:01.120
in every other aspect.

11:01.120 --> 11:03.410
But his grades trouble me so.

11:03.510 --> 11:04.480
I was planning

11:04.480 --> 11:05.600
to find him a tutor.

11:05.680 --> 11:06.910
But first, it's expensive.

11:06.910 --> 11:08.650
Second, he won't yield to any.

11:09.120 --> 11:10.240
But with his own cousins,

11:10.240 --> 11:11.150
it's definitely different.

11:11.150 --> 11:11.870
Exactly.

11:12.240 --> 11:13.150
We know each other,

11:13.150 --> 11:16.270
and they'll surely be more responsible
than an outsider, right?

11:16.270 --> 11:17.030
Besides,

11:17.050 --> 11:18.960
with their excellent grades,

11:18.980 --> 11:21.030
helping him with his homework

11:21.030 --> 11:22.720
should be a piece of cake.

11:24.750 --> 11:26.320
You came all the way here

11:26.320 --> 11:27.720
just to say this?

11:28.720 --> 11:29.720
You didn't have to
go through the trouble.

11:29.720 --> 11:31.200
A phone call would have sufficed.

11:31.200 --> 11:32.470
That won't do.

11:32.490 --> 11:35.220
As your uncle,
I have to come pick you up in person.

11:35.630 --> 11:36.290
Uncle,

11:36.750 --> 11:38.030
Lin Zhixia means that

11:38.030 --> 11:39.670
if you had called,

11:39.840 --> 11:41.750
she would have rejected you over the phone

11:41.750 --> 11:43.150
so you wouldn't have
made a trip for nothing.

11:43.150 --> 11:44.200
That's what she means.

11:44.200 --> 11:46.030
What these two mean is,

11:46.440 --> 11:47.640
they have good grades

11:47.910 --> 11:50.770
mostly because they love studying, right?

11:50.870 --> 11:52.510
A good student
is not necessarily a good teacher.

11:52.510 --> 11:55.200
They can't even help each other much.

11:57.360 --> 11:57.890
Uncle,

11:58.120 --> 12:00.200
studying really depends on oneself.

12:00.630 --> 12:02.790
Zeqiu and I just love studying.

12:03.080 --> 12:04.790
I think you should
pay attention to Zhuangzhuang

12:04.790 --> 12:07.050
and find out what his real interests are.

12:13.630 --> 12:14.670
Besides,

12:14.960 --> 12:17.090
we haven't seen each other for so long.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.080
You coming to me

12:18.080 --> 12:20.150
is no different from finding a tutor.

12:20.150 --> 12:20.790
I...

12:20.910 --> 12:22.480
Mom, I'm going to do my homework.

12:22.480 --> 12:23.550
Okay, go ahead.

12:35.480 --> 12:36.340
Eat something.

12:36.500 --> 12:37.960
We've just been chatting.

12:49.260 --> 12:51.420
[Input Text]

12:51.990 --> 12:54.910
[To: No Ordinary Human]

12:52.600 --> 12:54.840
Jiang Yubai, what are you doing?

13:03.490 --> 13:04.480
[Jiang Yubai, what are you doing?]

13:05.670 --> 13:08.320
[To: High-EQ Human]

13:08.350 --> 13:13.230
[Spacing out at home.]

13:09.390 --> 13:10.520
Spacing out at home.

13:16.600 --> 13:17.390
You?

13:17.150 --> 13:18.950
[Spacing out at home. You?]

13:26.840 --> 13:27.630
Son,

13:28.320 --> 13:30.250
you seem to be in a good mood lately.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.680
You're even texting

13:31.870 --> 13:33.360
with a smile on your face.

13:34.360 --> 13:35.150
Am I?

13:36.270 --> 13:37.120
Are you?

13:39.270 --> 13:40.800
I've seen it several times.

13:43.910 --> 13:44.670
Actually,

13:44.960 --> 13:46.320
I wanted to discuss

13:46.320 --> 13:47.780
our plans for the New Year.

13:48.510 --> 13:49.320
What plans?

13:50.960 --> 13:52.080
Your dad

13:52.480 --> 13:54.510
called this morning

13:54.630 --> 13:57.360
and said he bought you
a ticket to Singapore.

13:58.440 --> 13:59.200
I was thinking,

13:59.200 --> 14:01.390
you haven't seen him in years.

14:01.630 --> 14:03.480
Why not go visit him?

14:04.550 --> 14:06.210
He already booked the ticket.

14:06.550 --> 14:08.350
Is this a notice or a discussion?

14:09.150 --> 14:10.550
He hasn't changed at all.

14:10.750 --> 14:11.670
Still the same.

14:11.910 --> 14:14.120
Always putting his own needs first.

14:15.320 --> 14:16.380
When I was young, we followed him,

14:16.380 --> 14:18.860
moving between China and Singapore.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.630
Every time he gave an order,

14:20.630 --> 14:21.910
we had to follow.

14:22.240 --> 14:22.960
At school,

14:22.960 --> 14:25.290
I had to leave as soon as
I made new friends.

14:25.870 --> 14:28.200
Later, I didn't even dare to make friends.

14:29.270 --> 14:30.080
Is that so?

14:31.390 --> 14:32.790
Didn't I gradually realize

14:32.790 --> 14:34.030
this problem too?

14:35.720 --> 14:36.960
So after we divorced,

14:37.150 --> 14:38.910
I decided to bring you back

14:38.910 --> 14:40.440
to a familiar environment.

14:40.840 --> 14:42.670
You've been doing well lately,

14:42.670 --> 14:44.670
which proves my decision was right.

14:50.750 --> 14:52.550
If you don't want to go,

14:52.840 --> 14:53.910
we won't go.

14:54.440 --> 14:56.320
The way your dad does things

14:56.320 --> 14:58.080
is really annoying.

15:02.550 --> 15:03.840
But ultimately,

15:04.510 --> 15:06.240
isn't it because he misses you?

15:07.550 --> 15:08.390
He just wants

15:08.390 --> 15:10.930
to use the New Year as an opportunity

15:10.960 --> 15:13.370
to express his feelings to you.

15:13.440 --> 15:14.120
Mom,

15:14.600 --> 15:15.270
you and Dad

15:15.270 --> 15:17.470
are completely from different worlds.

15:17.510 --> 15:19.030
Besides, he betrayed you back then.

15:19.030 --> 15:20.890
Why do you always speak up for him?

15:23.080 --> 15:24.910
Matters between adults are
often complicated, helpless,

15:24.910 --> 15:26.040
and hard to explain.

15:29.150 --> 15:30.390
Your dad

15:30.630 --> 15:32.600
is certainly not a good husband.

15:33.270 --> 15:35.360
But that does not affect

15:35.360 --> 15:39.270
his sincere love and concern for his son.

15:44.360 --> 15:45.150
Then,

15:46.960 --> 15:48.360
do you want me to go?

15:49.750 --> 15:51.790
Of course, I respect your decision.

15:52.750 --> 15:53.390
But...

15:54.200 --> 15:56.800
I don't want to leave you alone
for the New Year.

15:58.390 --> 16:00.550
You don't have to worry about me.

16:01.240 --> 16:02.240
I haven't seen

16:02.360 --> 16:04.200
your grandparents for a long time either.

16:04.200 --> 16:06.670
So I can take this chance to visit them.

16:10.550 --> 16:11.480
Okay.

16:13.030 --> 16:13.840
Then,

16:16.870 --> 16:18.150
I'll go.

16:20.000 --> 16:20.910
It's a deal.

16:22.720 --> 16:23.510
Okay.

16:24.670 --> 16:26.550
Visit with a good mood.

16:27.750 --> 16:28.550
I'm leaving.

16:42.440 --> 16:44.440
Two relatives showed up uninvited,

16:44.630 --> 16:45.690
it's suffocating.

16:54.360 --> 16:56.120
Do you want to come out and hide?

17:00.650 --> 17:03.240
Nothing good ever happens
when my uncle and aunt show up.

17:03.240 --> 17:04.440
When they were young,

17:04.510 --> 17:05.550
my mom gave my uncle

17:05.550 --> 17:07.220
her opportunity to go to school.

17:07.220 --> 17:09.640
He finished college and became a lawyer,

17:09.640 --> 17:11.300
but when he looked at my mom...

17:12.589 --> 17:14.480
His gaze was full of disdain.

17:15.260 --> 17:16.440
Also, when Zeqiu was little,

17:16.440 --> 17:17.970
he was sick and needed surgery.

17:17.970 --> 17:20.930
My parents couldn't scrape
together enough money,

17:21.109 --> 17:22.790
so they had to borrow from my uncle.

17:22.790 --> 17:25.000
But he said he didn't have a single cent.

17:25.589 --> 17:26.829
And now look at him.

17:26.829 --> 17:28.349
He has the nerve to come to my house

17:28.349 --> 17:29.200
and ask Zeqiu and me

17:29.200 --> 17:30.920
to be free tutors for his son.

17:31.030 --> 17:31.960
So ridiculous.

17:45.550 --> 17:46.350
What's wrong?

17:47.240 --> 17:48.480
It's the first time I've seen you

17:48.480 --> 17:49.880
say so much in one breath.

17:51.840 --> 17:55.440
This kind of thing is exactly what
you vent to good friends about.

17:56.000 --> 17:57.930
I feel much better after saying it.

17:57.960 --> 17:59.110
Do you have any trouble?

17:59.110 --> 18:00.440
You can tell me about it.

18:07.720 --> 18:08.550
I don't think

18:09.550 --> 18:11.180
I have anything to vent about.

18:11.180 --> 18:12.200
That's good.

18:17.880 --> 18:18.790
He

18:18.790 --> 18:21.350
really wanted to be
involved in your growth,

18:21.400 --> 18:23.110
but because his method was wrong,

18:23.110 --> 18:25.550
it got interpreted as control.

18:26.110 --> 18:28.640
You'll understand when you enter society.

18:28.830 --> 18:30.350
He is your family,

18:30.830 --> 18:32.030
a family member who

18:32.330 --> 18:36.030
would never harm you no matter what.

18:49.450 --> 18:51.910
When I was young,
I always looked up to my dad.

18:53.110 --> 18:54.200
He was successful,

18:54.920 --> 18:55.790
capable,

18:57.640 --> 18:58.880
and quite handsome.

19:00.270 --> 19:01.640
He was always

19:02.000 --> 19:03.800
a perfect role model in my heart.

19:04.700 --> 19:05.840
So I never thought that

19:05.840 --> 19:07.500
he would betray my mom one day.

19:09.480 --> 19:10.200
Since that day,

19:10.200 --> 19:12.110
his image in my heart collapsed.

19:12.640 --> 19:14.370
It had a pretty big impact on me.

19:15.510 --> 19:17.570
It was as if all the evidence of beauty

19:17.960 --> 19:22.000
and happiness in my heart disappeared.

19:23.920 --> 19:25.310
Since then, my relationship with him

19:25.310 --> 19:26.570
has become very tense.

19:27.860 --> 19:28.980
Even now, I don't know

19:28.980 --> 19:31.110
how to persuade myself to forgive him.

19:38.000 --> 19:39.200
Today he just booked me

19:39.200 --> 19:40.510
a ticket to Singapore.

19:41.830 --> 19:43.070
But I'm not sure

19:43.880 --> 19:45.830
if I can properly face him

19:47.070 --> 19:48.270
and his new family.

19:57.380 --> 19:59.160
It's also my first time hearing you

19:59.160 --> 20:00.560
say so much in one breath.

20:04.730 --> 20:06.550
Are you feeling better now?

20:08.960 --> 20:09.750
Much better.

20:12.070 --> 20:13.440
Sometimes I think how nice

20:13.440 --> 20:14.160
it'd be if we could

20:14.160 --> 20:15.790
freely choose our family.

20:18.730 --> 20:19.880
Could it be that

20:20.660 --> 20:21.700
we've already been

20:21.700 --> 20:23.100
quietly making choices?

20:24.200 --> 20:26.330
Staying away from people who hurt you,

20:26.350 --> 20:28.480
getting close to the ones who warm you,

20:28.550 --> 20:31.810
and keeping a place in your heart
for the important people.

20:32.350 --> 20:33.150
These actions

20:33.590 --> 20:35.310
are all redefining family.

20:56.920 --> 20:58.790
I want to discuss something with you two.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.160
Your dad and I are going to
your uncle's house for the New Year

21:00.160 --> 21:01.310
to keep your grandparents company.

21:01.310 --> 21:02.110
You two...

21:02.110 --> 21:02.960
I'm not going.

21:04.200 --> 21:04.880
Zhixia.

21:08.590 --> 21:09.350
You guys go.

21:09.350 --> 21:10.550
I'll stay home alone.

21:12.310 --> 21:13.400
Can you cook?

21:14.440 --> 21:16.560
What are you going to eat alone at home?

21:16.560 --> 21:18.240
Leave me the keys to the supermarket,

21:18.240 --> 21:19.310
and I won't go hungry.

21:19.310 --> 21:21.970
No way. You can't just eat those
for the New Year.

21:23.160 --> 21:24.480
You know exactly what

21:24.480 --> 21:25.830
Uncle and Aunt are like.

21:26.320 --> 21:28.310
If it weren't for Mom's sake,

21:28.350 --> 21:30.280
I would have lost my temper long ago

21:30.310 --> 21:32.240
over the demands he made last time.

21:33.920 --> 21:36.310
I also think his demands
were quite unreasonable.

21:36.310 --> 21:38.110
That's why I didn't ask you to go early.

21:38.110 --> 21:39.570
It's just for the New Year.

21:39.720 --> 21:42.050
I want to spend the New Year
with my family.

21:43.750 --> 21:46.210
Those relatives
don't treat us like family.

21:46.400 --> 21:48.400
Why should we treat them like family

21:48.400 --> 21:49.660
and try to please them?

21:53.880 --> 21:55.350
How about this? I'll stay.

21:58.070 --> 21:59.070
I'll cook for you.

21:59.880 --> 22:00.680
Really?

22:02.880 --> 22:03.830
That's great.

22:04.240 --> 22:05.640
Then I can eat

22:05.800 --> 22:07.510
tomato salad, cola chicken wings,

22:07.510 --> 22:08.720
eight-treasure rice,
and braised spare ribs.

22:08.720 --> 22:09.480
Okay, that's enough.

22:09.480 --> 22:11.140
I can't make that many dishes.

22:11.550 --> 22:13.110
As long as we don't go hungry, it's fine.

22:13.110 --> 22:14.350
These two kids.

22:14.440 --> 22:15.880
All right, it's settled then.

22:15.880 --> 22:17.400
Take good care of your sister at home.

22:17.400 --> 22:19.550
Your dad and I will be back
in a few days, okay?

22:19.550 --> 22:20.550
-Okay.
-Okay.

22:27.720 --> 22:30.770
[To: No Ordinary Human]

22:30.050 --> 22:32.290
My parents agreed to let me
not go to my uncle's house.

22:32.290 --> 22:35.150
I can spend the New Year at home
with Zeqiu this year.

22:40.890 --> 22:47.770
[From: No Ordinary Human]

22:41.940 --> 22:43.200
My flight is tomorrow.

23:02.030 --> 23:03.350
Be careful on the way.

23:03.440 --> 23:04.900
Text me when you're there.

23:09.750 --> 23:10.480
Got it.

23:46.550 --> 23:47.200
Dad.

23:47.720 --> 23:49.350
Son, are you on your way?

23:50.030 --> 23:52.680
Your Aunt Wu has already
made the dumplings.

23:52.830 --> 23:54.360
We're just waiting for you.

23:55.400 --> 23:56.310
I'm on my way.

23:56.310 --> 23:57.030
Okay.

23:57.350 --> 23:59.410
Just contact Uncle Kun when you land.

23:59.590 --> 24:01.390
He'll pick you up at the airport.

24:02.200 --> 24:03.590
Jiang Feng, come take a look.

24:03.590 --> 24:04.850
The baby keeps crying.

24:05.960 --> 24:07.690
Wait a minute. I'm on the phone.

24:08.310 --> 24:09.090
Don't cry. Don't cry.

24:09.090 --> 24:10.420
Daddy will be here soon.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.880
Jiang Feng, hurry up.

24:12.440 --> 24:13.640
Be careful on the way.

24:13.830 --> 24:15.070
Tell me what you want to eat.

24:15.070 --> 24:16.510
It's your first time coming to our house.

24:16.510 --> 24:18.440
I just realized my ID isn't with me.

24:18.770 --> 24:19.700
I have to go back.

24:21.090 --> 24:22.420
If I still can't find it,

24:23.880 --> 24:24.830
go on without me.

24:25.270 --> 24:26.240
Hello? Son?

24:34.300 --> 24:36.450
[Passport]

24:42.240 --> 24:43.100
Is it straight?

24:43.400 --> 24:44.190
Yeah, it's pretty straight.

24:44.190 --> 24:45.720
Why do I feel like
the left side is higher?

24:45.720 --> 24:46.880
I actually think the left side is lower.

24:46.880 --> 24:47.590
Really?

24:47.590 --> 24:48.160
Okay.

24:48.160 --> 24:49.420
-Tingting.
-How is it?

24:49.590 --> 24:51.320
-Dad is back.
-Your dad's back.

24:51.590 --> 24:52.710
Dad!

24:54.310 --> 24:55.440
I missed you so much.

24:55.550 --> 24:56.350
What took you so long?

24:56.350 --> 24:58.750
By my calculations,
you should have arrived this morning.

24:58.750 --> 24:59.680
I went

24:59.880 --> 25:01.680
to buy a gift for Tingting.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.110
For me?

25:03.110 --> 25:05.110
More like a gift package. It's huge.

25:05.680 --> 25:06.440
She really is your own.

25:06.440 --> 25:07.830
What is it?

25:09.480 --> 25:10.480
It looks so good.

25:10.590 --> 25:11.880
This color is so nice.

25:11.880 --> 25:12.750
Of course.

25:12.920 --> 25:14.640
Well? Do you like it?

25:15.200 --> 25:17.270
Dad, do you fathers all think that

25:17.270 --> 25:18.880
girls like pink their whole lives?

25:18.880 --> 25:20.160
This is way too pink.

25:20.960 --> 25:23.160
It's perfect for the New Year. So festive.

25:23.160 --> 25:24.000
Look at this color.

25:24.000 --> 25:25.930
You'd look great in it. It's yours.

25:27.160 --> 25:28.000
Well...

25:28.070 --> 25:29.270
I can actually fit in this size.

25:29.270 --> 25:30.200
You'll look great in it.

25:30.200 --> 25:31.000
Very nice.

25:31.480 --> 25:32.270
Tingting,

25:32.640 --> 25:34.070
in Daddy's heart,

25:34.070 --> 25:36.200
haven't you always been a little girl?

25:36.400 --> 25:37.000
Yes.

25:37.000 --> 25:39.350
So, how did your exams go this year?

25:39.640 --> 25:41.970
Don't talk about that during the New Year.

25:42.640 --> 25:43.920
Tingting and I went to make a wish.

25:43.920 --> 25:45.000
They said you shouldn't
keep talking about it,

25:45.000 --> 25:46.200
or it won't come true.

25:48.000 --> 25:49.600
Okay, not another word of it.

25:49.690 --> 25:51.830
Let's cook then.

25:51.830 --> 25:53.070
Hurry up. We were waiting for you.

25:53.070 --> 25:53.750
I'm starving.

25:53.750 --> 25:54.510
I'll go wash my hands.

25:54.510 --> 25:55.510
Honestly.

25:56.070 --> 25:57.480
This one seems okay.

26:00.750 --> 26:05.490
[New Year's Eve dinner]

26:03.880 --> 26:04.680
Leek.

26:04.880 --> 26:05.440
Leak?

26:05.550 --> 26:06.310
Leek.

26:06.710 --> 26:07.620
[New Year's Eve dinner]

26:06.920 --> 26:07.720
Leak?

26:07.720 --> 26:08.480
Leek!

26:08.810 --> 26:10.710
[New Year's Eve dinner]

26:09.960 --> 26:10.830
Big or small?

26:10.830 --> 26:11.790
A big one.

26:14.720 --> 26:15.480
Aren't you going to slice it?

26:15.480 --> 26:16.200
You didn't tell me to.

26:16.200 --> 26:18.110
If I tell you now, will you slice it?

26:18.110 --> 26:19.030
Forget it.

26:21.960 --> 26:23.070
It's getting burnt, Zeqiu.

26:23.070 --> 26:24.350
Okay, here, take this.

26:25.440 --> 26:26.680
Is this step correct?

26:26.680 --> 26:27.720
Of course it is.

26:27.920 --> 26:30.110
You're not controlling the heat very well.

26:30.110 --> 26:32.040
I'm not controlling the heat well?

26:32.240 --> 26:33.970
It's definitely your problem.

26:36.440 --> 26:39.030
Come on, who was the one
who swore confidently that

26:39.030 --> 26:40.480
we'd never eat instant noodles
for New Year's Eve dinner?

26:40.480 --> 26:41.880
Stop talking. Salt.

26:41.880 --> 26:42.680
Add some salt.

26:48.000 --> 26:49.030
Look for it.

26:57.750 --> 26:58.880
Isn't that too much?

26:58.920 --> 26:59.640
It's fine.

26:59.780 --> 27:01.200
It'll be flavorful and delicious.

27:01.200 --> 27:02.070
Who's gonna eat this?

27:02.070 --> 27:02.960
You, you.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.020
You can have it all.

27:06.240 --> 27:07.000
Coming!

27:14.640 --> 27:15.550
Jiang Yubai?

27:16.680 --> 27:20.310
Lin Zhixia, I'm here to wish you
a Happy New Year's Eve.

27:23.000 --> 27:24.530
You didn't go to Singapore?

27:27.160 --> 27:27.960
Lin Zhixia!

27:29.000 --> 27:30.000
Where did you go?

27:30.400 --> 27:32.530
-Come in.
-Was that salt you passed me?

27:33.160 --> 27:33.880
Yeah.

27:34.880 --> 27:36.080
Everything browned.

27:37.440 --> 27:38.510
I even tasted it.

27:40.350 --> 27:41.280
Why are you here?

27:42.200 --> 27:44.480
I originally came to say hi to Lin Zhixia.

27:44.760 --> 27:46.160
But now I think

27:46.480 --> 27:47.830
I can be more useful.

27:49.030 --> 27:50.360
You know how to fix a wok?

28:43.000 --> 28:44.930
May you have abundance every year.

28:48.510 --> 28:50.070
How about we have hot pot?

28:51.590 --> 28:52.310
Sure.

28:54.880 --> 28:56.210
I'm fine with anything.

28:59.030 --> 28:59.660
I know.

29:00.120 --> 29:02.550
[Shen]

29:00.270 --> 29:02.000
Didn't you tell me that before?

29:02.480 --> 29:04.110
What about next year?

29:04.830 --> 29:06.360
Can you come back next year?

29:07.530 --> 29:08.330
Next year?

29:09.700 --> 29:11.350
I do have a vacation next year.

29:11.350 --> 29:12.480
But it's hard to say.

29:13.030 --> 29:15.440
It depends on the arrangements
at the observation station.

29:15.440 --> 29:18.440
Our family has gotten used to it
after all these years.

29:18.550 --> 29:20.350
Have a good New Year with our son.

29:25.330 --> 29:25.790
Okay.

29:26.290 --> 29:27.220
Hold on a second.

29:33.920 --> 29:35.310
Happy New Year, Dad.

29:36.270 --> 29:37.400
Happy New Year, Son.

29:38.310 --> 29:39.680
I'm hanging up now.

29:46.030 --> 29:48.000
Why are there still

29:48.070 --> 29:50.240
so many people eating out
on New Year's Eve?

29:50.240 --> 29:52.200
Yeah, it's quite normal.

29:52.310 --> 29:54.160
Everyone is getting busier nowadays.

29:54.160 --> 29:55.440
Actually, people have gradually

29:55.440 --> 29:58.770
come to accept having New Year's Eve
dinner at a restaurant.

29:59.640 --> 30:00.310
Is that so?

30:01.310 --> 30:02.440
Why do I feel like...

30:04.880 --> 30:07.740
it's just because someone
doesn't know how to cook?

30:10.880 --> 30:13.210
You were waiting to say that, weren't you?

30:19.000 --> 30:20.000
Waiter.

30:22.290 --> 30:23.690
Hello, how can I help you?

30:23.790 --> 30:24.400
Hello.

30:24.720 --> 30:27.680
What about the 4 extra portions
of dumplings I ordered earlier?

30:27.680 --> 30:28.740
They've been packed for you

30:28.740 --> 30:29.900
-and placed at the reception.
-Okay. Thank you.

30:29.900 --> 30:30.830
You're welcome.

30:34.310 --> 30:36.310
Are you going back to the dorm later?

30:36.550 --> 30:37.350
I have to.

30:37.830 --> 30:40.030
There are quite a few projects
this semester.

30:40.030 --> 30:41.110
Two of my master's students

30:41.110 --> 30:42.850
aren't planning
to go home for the New Year.

30:42.850 --> 30:45.310
And two others
simply couldn't get tickets.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.310
So I'll

30:46.390 --> 30:47.750
bring them some food and check on them.

30:47.750 --> 30:49.410
They are just kids, after all.

31:06.960 --> 31:08.030
Don't worry.

31:08.310 --> 31:09.910
I've made arrangements too.

31:10.070 --> 31:10.920
Tomorrow,

31:11.310 --> 31:12.640
I'll take a proper break

31:12.880 --> 31:14.140
and stay home with you.

31:14.180 --> 31:14.810
Okay?

31:15.830 --> 31:16.290
Okay.

31:17.830 --> 31:18.640
You eat too.

31:25.510 --> 31:26.310
Waiter.

31:29.550 --> 31:30.200
Yes?

31:30.200 --> 31:31.270
Bill, please.

31:31.390 --> 31:32.510
This way to the reception desk.

31:32.510 --> 31:33.160
Okay.

31:39.480 --> 31:42.070
Happy New Year!

31:42.720 --> 31:43.930
May all your wishes come true.

31:43.930 --> 31:46.330
Look at you, sweetie.
You're so good with words.

31:46.330 --> 31:47.530
Thank you, Grandma.

31:49.290 --> 31:50.220
Eat more.

31:55.250 --> 31:56.270
Is it delicious?

31:56.350 --> 31:57.010
Delicious.

32:00.960 --> 32:01.760
Are you happy?

32:02.270 --> 32:04.270
Grandma, give me a big red envelope.

32:04.980 --> 32:06.180
Is that all you're thinking about?

32:05.290 --> 32:09.040
[Contacts]

32:18.800 --> 32:19.380
[Contacts]

32:19.450 --> 32:25.850
[Call Lin Zhixia]

32:25.640 --> 32:27.070
Jiang Yubai, to your left.

32:27.070 --> 32:27.920
Left?

32:34.200 --> 32:35.330
Hello, Shen Fuxuan.

32:35.480 --> 32:36.680
Happy New Year's Eve.

32:37.310 --> 32:38.510
We haven't eaten yet.

32:40.640 --> 32:42.550
Me, my brother, and Jiang Yubai.

32:43.920 --> 32:44.980
You're coming too?

32:48.330 --> 32:49.590
Pair of tens.

32:50.880 --> 32:52.030
Anyone want a pair of twos?

32:52.030 --> 32:52.830
Anyone?

32:52.830 --> 32:54.030
Bomb.

32:54.270 --> 32:54.750
Nice!

32:54.750 --> 32:55.590
Hold it.

32:55.680 --> 32:56.880
Four Kings!

32:58.000 --> 32:59.270
Mom, I won again.

32:59.270 --> 33:01.070
I haven't lost all night.

33:01.510 --> 33:02.460
Stick it on.

33:03.330 --> 33:05.180
My face is so clean.

33:05.490 --> 33:07.140
A certain kid
isn't allowed to cry tonight.

33:07.140 --> 33:08.050
I won't cry.

33:08.050 --> 33:08.570
Honey.

33:08.570 --> 33:10.770
I'll definitely win it back next round.

33:12.530 --> 33:14.220
Who is it? Go open the door.

33:15.380 --> 33:16.290
You're cheating.

33:16.290 --> 33:17.500
Who's cheating?

33:19.220 --> 33:20.220
Why are you here?

33:20.420 --> 33:21.090
Uncle, Aunt,

33:21.090 --> 33:23.020
Grandpa, Grandma, Happy New Year.

33:23.140 --> 33:25.610
My mom specially made this stewed meat,

33:25.610 --> 33:26.980
and asked me to bring some to you.

33:26.980 --> 33:27.700
There's some for the Lins too.

33:27.700 --> 33:29.010
I'm bringing it to them later.

33:29.010 --> 33:30.090
Thank your mom for us.

33:30.090 --> 33:30.980
Duan.

33:31.610 --> 33:33.090
Dad, Mom, look at this kid.

33:33.090 --> 33:34.460
He's just a late bloomer.

33:34.460 --> 33:35.810
He wasn't this tall last year.

33:35.810 --> 33:36.670
He's grown now.

33:36.770 --> 33:37.460
Right, Uncle?

33:37.460 --> 33:39.250
I can even dunk this year.

33:39.770 --> 33:41.940
All brawn and no brains.

33:42.570 --> 33:43.900
Watch your mouth.

33:43.900 --> 33:46.230
Duan's grades are much better than yours.

33:46.330 --> 33:47.130
That's right.

33:49.140 --> 33:50.000
How's your dad?

33:50.180 --> 33:51.980
Playing cards at home too?

33:52.660 --> 33:53.770
Yes.

33:53.900 --> 33:56.250
They started playing
right after an early dinner.

33:56.250 --> 33:56.940
All right.

33:57.160 --> 34:00.010
I'll go over and play
a few rounds with your dad later.

34:00.010 --> 34:00.770
Save it.

34:00.770 --> 34:02.290
Did they invite you?

34:02.310 --> 34:03.850
We're practically family.

34:05.180 --> 34:05.940
By the way,

34:06.180 --> 34:07.460
the two kids from the Lin family

34:07.460 --> 34:09.050
didn't go to their grandma's today.

34:09.050 --> 34:10.460
Tingting,

34:10.460 --> 34:11.730
go to the kitchen

34:11.730 --> 34:14.570
and bring them the big bag of snacks
I bought this afternoon.

34:14.570 --> 34:15.980
No need.

34:16.010 --> 34:17.900
They don't lack this kind of stuff.

34:17.900 --> 34:21.560
I'm waiting for the Spring Festival Gala
to watch my idol perform.

34:23.130 --> 34:25.500
Shouldn't we kids hang out too?

34:26.780 --> 34:27.500
Exactly.

34:27.500 --> 34:28.900
Go on, have fun.

34:29.230 --> 34:29.980
Let's go.

34:31.340 --> 34:32.090
Fine.

34:32.980 --> 34:34.530
Grandpa, Grandma,
I'll go hang out for a bit

34:34.530 --> 34:35.659
and come back later.

34:35.820 --> 34:36.460
Bye.

34:36.460 --> 34:37.260
Bye, Uncle, Aunt.

34:37.260 --> 34:38.590
Bye, Grandpa, Grandma.

34:43.610 --> 34:44.540
Have a meatball.

34:44.860 --> 34:45.650
Delicious.

34:46.780 --> 34:47.570
This...

34:47.650 --> 34:49.110
This should be cooked too.

34:50.260 --> 34:51.380
Crab sticks.

34:54.090 --> 34:55.290
Eat it while it's hot.

34:55.489 --> 34:56.500
Thank you.

34:58.010 --> 34:58.940
Potatoes.

34:59.380 --> 35:00.210
Just eat.

35:02.940 --> 35:03.780
Thanks.

35:07.860 --> 35:08.650
Hot, hot!

35:10.450 --> 35:11.650
Someone's knocking.

35:11.690 --> 35:13.260
Who is it this time?

35:13.650 --> 35:14.340
There's someone else?

35:13.980 --> 35:15.870
[Harmony brings prosperity]

35:14.340 --> 35:15.940
It's really lively tonight.

35:16.300 --> 35:17.900
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

35:17.900 --> 35:18.820
You guys are here.

35:18.820 --> 35:19.300
Come in.

35:19.340 --> 35:20.200
Happy New Year.

35:20.210 --> 35:20.940
Happy New Year.

35:20.940 --> 35:22.730
-Gotta spend the New Year with you guys.
-Who is it?

35:22.730 --> 35:23.260
Duan Qiyan.

35:23.260 --> 35:24.010
You sneaked out.

35:24.010 --> 35:25.050
-Happy New Year.
-Happy New Year.

35:25.050 --> 35:26.570
Perfect timing. We're eating.

35:26.570 --> 35:27.260
Really?

35:29.170 --> 35:30.130
Jiang, Shen?

35:30.130 --> 35:31.210
Why are you guys here?

35:31.210 --> 35:31.980
-We…
-I...

35:31.980 --> 35:33.460
-I’m bored. I’m here to celebrate.
-Celebrate the New Year, yes.

35:33.460 --> 35:34.790
Let's sit down and talk.

35:35.540 --> 35:42.090
[Harmony brings prosperity]

35:37.500 --> 35:40.500
My dad made braised pork ribs

35:40.500 --> 35:42.010
and stir-fried beef with bamboo shoots.

35:42.010 --> 35:43.210
They're really good.

35:43.420 --> 35:44.730
Mr. Duan's specialty.

35:45.050 --> 35:45.860
Of course.

35:46.530 --> 35:47.660
Is the opening over?

35:48.000 --> 35:48.530
It's over.

35:48.530 --> 35:50.860
Your idol had
a lot of screen time just now.

35:51.840 --> 35:53.690
Duan Qiyan, it's all your fault.

35:53.960 --> 35:54.710
You fell hard on your butt,

35:54.710 --> 35:56.440
and made me miss seeing my idol.

35:56.460 --> 35:58.150
Well, why were you so anxious?

35:58.420 --> 35:59.480
It was because you rushed me

35:59.480 --> 36:00.590
that I fell and bruised my butt,

36:00.590 --> 36:02.210
and you don't even feel sorry for me.

36:02.210 --> 36:03.050
Let me tell you,

36:03.050 --> 36:05.110
the Spring Festival Gala
will be replayed for 3 days.

36:05.110 --> 36:06.460
Don't worry.

36:07.210 --> 36:07.940
Replayed?

36:08.420 --> 36:09.650
I don't care.
Anyway, I've been looking forward

36:09.650 --> 36:11.010
to their performance since
the announcement.

36:11.010 --> 36:12.260
You have to take responsibility for this.

36:12.260 --> 36:13.010
Okay, okay.

36:13.010 --> 36:13.810
Okay, my lady.

36:14.070 --> 36:15.610
I'll set an alarm

36:16.590 --> 36:19.480
and let you know
as soon as the replay starts,

36:19.650 --> 36:20.300
okay?

36:20.840 --> 36:21.590
Fine.

36:21.590 --> 36:22.400
You two, quiet down.

36:22.400 --> 36:23.550
You're so noisy right after you arrived.

36:23.550 --> 36:25.320
Alright, alright,
stop arguing during the New Year.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.570
Are you two kids?

36:28.670 --> 36:29.480
The ones on top are cooked.

36:29.480 --> 36:30.410
You can eat them.

36:30.590 --> 36:31.710
So delicious. Grab some.

36:31.710 --> 36:32.400
Just you.

36:32.550 --> 36:34.110
The beef meatball hit me.

36:34.800 --> 36:35.710
Hit it back.

36:36.880 --> 36:38.550
It's so lively. It's so good.

36:38.760 --> 36:39.900
Originally, for this New Year,

36:39.900 --> 36:41.710
I thought
I'd just spend it with my sister.

36:41.710 --> 36:42.860
But everyone came.

36:43.480 --> 36:45.030
Thanks to Jiang Yubai

36:45.030 --> 36:46.110
for preparing this sumptuous dinner,

36:46.110 --> 36:49.070
and thanks to Duan Qiyan's dad
for contributing two dishes to the table.

36:49.070 --> 36:50.550
It's nothing. You're welcome.

36:50.550 --> 36:51.710
Happy New Year, friends.

36:51.710 --> 36:52.630
-Happy New Year!
-Happy New Year!

36:52.630 --> 36:53.920
Happy New Year!

36:53.920 --> 36:55.380
-Happy New Year!
-Cheers.

36:58.630 --> 36:59.630
Come on, eat up.

36:59.890 --> 37:02.030
The Jin family has produced a top student.

37:02.030 --> 37:03.610
Let's toast to Baihui again.

37:03.610 --> 37:04.550
Come on, cheers!

37:04.550 --> 37:06.080
-Cheers.
-Cheers! Cheers!

37:06.320 --> 37:07.150
Baihui,

37:07.280 --> 37:08.480
you've made us proud.

37:09.440 --> 37:10.570
Thank you, Grandma.

37:11.400 --> 37:12.280
Baihui

37:12.880 --> 37:15.210
inherited her dad's talent for studying.

37:15.480 --> 37:16.810
Jinquan loves to learn.

37:16.960 --> 37:18.920
He had good grades since he was little.

37:18.920 --> 37:20.360
He joined a newspaper
right after graduation

37:20.360 --> 37:22.670
and became a section chief shortly after.

37:22.670 --> 37:23.480
Brother,

37:23.630 --> 37:24.670
don't say that.

37:25.360 --> 37:27.360
Hearing that makes me a bit ashamed.

37:27.760 --> 37:29.000
Up to now,

37:29.280 --> 37:31.010
I'm still just a section chief.

37:31.840 --> 37:33.550
-Why mention that?
-It's understandable.

37:33.550 --> 37:35.210
It's mainly because
he has a scholar's temperament.

37:35.210 --> 37:36.900
He's not the type to fight for things.

37:36.900 --> 37:37.730
Right, Mom?

37:38.260 --> 37:39.460
Of course.

37:39.460 --> 37:41.500
Scheming with those people

37:41.500 --> 37:43.210
is a total waste of my time.

37:43.530 --> 37:44.730
Those people at work

37:44.730 --> 37:46.060
are too short-sighted.

37:46.500 --> 37:47.630
My biggest priority

37:47.690 --> 37:49.130
is education.

37:49.660 --> 37:50.840
On a larger scale,

37:51.050 --> 37:53.360
it's about the prosperity of our family.

37:54.470 --> 37:59.190
[From: Lin Zhixia]

37:54.980 --> 37:55.530
Yes.

37:55.840 --> 37:57.370
Happy New Year, Jin Baihui.

37:57.590 --> 37:59.450
How's your New Year's Eve dinner?

37:59.590 --> 38:01.190
Then we must propose a toast.

38:01.650 --> 38:03.690
Baihui is the top of her grade this year.

38:01.710 --> 38:06.710
[To: Lin Zhixia]

38:04.050 --> 38:05.940
Next, she'll be the top scorer
on the college entrance exam.

38:05.940 --> 38:06.530
Baihui,

38:07.460 --> 38:08.530
you can't slack off.

38:08.530 --> 38:10.440
We are counting on you
to bring honor to our family.

38:10.440 --> 38:12.650
Our Baihui bears a heavy responsibility.

38:12.650 --> 38:13.980
I must drink this glass.

38:14.280 --> 38:15.780
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

38:18.810 --> 38:19.440
[To: Lin Zhixia]

38:19.380 --> 38:20.380
Happy New Year.

38:19.550 --> 38:22.100
[Happy New Year, Jin Baihui.
How's your New Year's Eve dinner?]

38:23.260 --> 38:23.900
Baihui.

38:24.130 --> 38:25.170
Put your phone away.

38:25.170 --> 38:28.170
I haven't seen you
toast your elders all night.

38:28.380 --> 38:29.570
What did I tell you?

38:31.690 --> 38:33.150
Then I'll toast everyone.

38:33.340 --> 38:34.300
Grandma.

38:34.500 --> 38:35.570
Happy New Year,

38:35.570 --> 38:37.570
I wish you good health and longevity.

38:37.570 --> 38:39.170
Good, thank you.

38:40.300 --> 38:41.690
Auntie, Uncle,

38:41.690 --> 38:44.150
I wish you success at work
and great fortune.

38:44.730 --> 38:46.010
Thank you.

38:49.820 --> 38:50.780
Dad, Mom,

38:51.780 --> 38:54.780
thank you for your hard work
and dedication.

38:54.860 --> 38:55.720
Happy New Year.

38:56.860 --> 38:58.790
-Happy New Year.
-You’ve grown up.

39:00.290 --> 39:01.620
Baihui is so wonderful.

39:02.010 --> 39:02.980
By the way, Brother,

39:02.980 --> 39:04.780
when are Jindi and her boyfriend

39:04.940 --> 39:05.860
coming back?

39:06.340 --> 39:07.610
The second or third day
of the New Year, I think.

39:07.610 --> 39:08.420
Okay.

39:08.460 --> 39:09.780
Let us know when the time comes,
Sister-in-law.

39:08.490 --> 39:12.210
[Happy New Year]

39:09.820 --> 39:10.780
I'll treat them to a meal,

39:10.780 --> 39:11.860
and we can have another lively gathering.

39:11.860 --> 39:13.010
Yes, let's gather again.

39:12.770 --> 39:20.260
[To: Lin Zhixia]

39:13.010 --> 39:13.690
Okay.

39:14.940 --> 39:16.340
Actually, I'm not happy.

39:16.530 --> 39:19.260
It's the New Year, and my dad
is still scolding me.

39:20.050 --> 39:21.050
My parents are not here.

39:20.300 --> 39:25.520
[From: Lin Zhixia]

39:21.510 --> 39:23.760
The members of Class Break are all here
at my house.

39:23.760 --> 39:25.620
Does the lead singer want to join?

39:31.690 --> 39:32.380
Mom,

39:33.090 --> 39:33.820
I'm full.

39:33.820 --> 39:35.150
I want to go out for a bit.

39:36.090 --> 39:38.290
Where are you going during the New Year?

39:40.900 --> 39:42.610
I'm going out to watch the fireworks.

39:42.610 --> 39:44.210
All the elders are here.

39:44.450 --> 39:45.610
It's the New Year.

39:45.730 --> 39:46.820
It's the New Year.

39:47.010 --> 39:48.150
Don't scold the child.

39:48.150 --> 39:50.010
-No, Mom.
-No, I'm not scolding her.

39:50.010 --> 39:51.210
Today is the New Year.

39:51.530 --> 39:53.780
Even machines need a rest
after working for a year.

39:53.780 --> 39:54.780
Baihui, go ahead.

39:55.360 --> 39:56.490
Uncle has your back.

39:58.730 --> 40:00.130
-Okay. Go.
-Go.

40:02.170 --> 40:03.130
Sure, go ahead.

40:04.340 --> 40:05.170
Then I'll go.

40:05.780 --> 40:06.460
Happy New Year!

40:06.460 --> 40:07.130
Come back early.

40:07.130 --> 40:07.780
Okay.

40:08.420 --> 40:09.670
Call me if anything happens.

40:09.670 --> 40:10.870
She's such a good kid.

40:43.950 --> 40:44.690
Why are you here?

40:44.690 --> 40:45.520
Perfect timing.

40:45.520 --> 40:46.110
Let's go.

40:46.110 --> 40:46.500
Where to?

40:46.500 --> 40:47.590
Set off firecrackers.

40:47.590 --> 40:48.320
We're lighting sparklers.

40:48.320 --> 40:48.780
Sparklers.

40:48.780 --> 40:49.050
Let's go.

40:49.050 --> 40:49.650
Hurry up.

41:07.190 --> 41:11.500
♪ I'm like the gentle clouds in the sky ♪

41:12.490 --> 41:16.480
♪ Looking forward
to the stop of the night breeze ♪

41:17.870 --> 41:22.260
♪ I'm wandering about carefully,
looking for the answer ♪

41:23.470 --> 41:27.260
♪ The meteors fly past,
silencing thoughts ♪

41:29.270 --> 41:32.900
♪ Please, give me some clues ♪

41:33.970 --> 41:40.730
♪ I hope you can see through
my situation and confusion ♪

41:41.560 --> 41:44.510
♪ And save me ♪

41:44.730 --> 41:50.150
♪ Can you hear me? Why won't you answer? ♪

41:50.580 --> 41:53.970
♪ I'm calling you secretly at night ♪

41:55.170 --> 42:00.470
♪ The moon whispers
fond words by my ears ♪

42:01.130 --> 42:06.380
♪ It asks if you're still there
through ups and downs ♪

42:06.510 --> 42:11.490
♪ Am I lying? I answer my own questions ♪

42:11.840 --> 42:16.470
♪ But I've already fallen,
I can't help it, oh ♪

42:16.630 --> 42:22.190
♪ Forgive me for being silly
for you and only you ♪

42:22.490 --> 42:26.910
♪ My desires turn into ocean waves
in my dreams ♪

42:27.280 --> 42:32.730
♪ Can you hear me? Why won't you answer? ♪

42:33.430 --> 42:36.860
♪ I'm calling you secretly at night ♪

42:37.790 --> 42:43.120
♪ The moon whispers
fond words by my ears ♪

42:43.900 --> 42:49.020
♪ It asks if you're still there
through ups and downs ♪

42:49.320 --> 42:54.070
♪ Am I lying? I answer my own questions ♪

42:54.490 --> 42:59.000
♪ But I've already fallen,
I can't help it, oh ♪

42:59.300 --> 43:06.290
♪ Forgive me for being silly
for you and only you ♪

43:07.620 --> 43:14.810
♪ My desires turn into ocean waves
in my dreams, lapping gently ♪

43:11.780 --> 43:12.860
Since everyone

43:13.130 --> 43:14.460
is gathered here today,

43:14.610 --> 43:15.650
let's play a game.

43:16.300 --> 43:19.030
I have a test that's perfect
for us to do right now.

43:19.130 --> 43:20.260
Doing a test on a holiday?

43:20.260 --> 43:21.990
No, it's a psychological test.

43:22.570 --> 43:23.300
You scared me.

43:23.300 --> 43:24.760
Please listen carefully.

43:24.860 --> 43:25.690
Imagine

43:25.690 --> 43:27.900
we have to travel with a group of animals,

43:27.900 --> 43:30.900
specifically a monkey,
a snake, and a bird.

43:31.210 --> 43:32.940
How would you travel with them?

43:38.650 --> 43:39.450
I'll go first.

43:39.820 --> 43:40.650
Sorry.

43:42.500 --> 43:44.570
I'd carry the monkey on my shoulder.

43:45.240 --> 43:47.860
The snake can wrap around the monkey,

43:48.780 --> 43:50.010
and the bird can sit on my head.

43:50.010 --> 43:51.410
Laying eggs on your head.

43:52.300 --> 43:53.570
Let me have a go.

43:53.690 --> 43:54.460
The monkey...

43:54.460 --> 43:56.300
I'd hold the monkey in my arms.

43:56.610 --> 43:57.860
The snake can lead the way,

43:57.860 --> 43:59.860
and the bird can rest on my shoulder.

44:00.610 --> 44:01.820
As for me, anything is fine.

44:01.820 --> 44:03.550
The 3 of them can just follow me.

44:04.980 --> 44:06.570
-I'd hold the monkey's hand.
-I'd hold the monkey's hand.

44:06.570 --> 44:07.530
-You go first.
-You go first.

44:07.530 --> 44:09.130
-You go first.
-You go first.

44:09.380 --> 44:10.610
You go ahead.

44:10.610 --> 44:11.940
Then I'll go first.

44:13.380 --> 44:14.840
I'd hold the monkey's hand

44:14.940 --> 44:16.670
and keep the snake in my pocket.

44:17.940 --> 44:19.170
The bird can just fly along.

44:19.170 --> 44:20.630
That's what I thought too.

44:23.340 --> 44:24.470
What a coincidence.

44:26.610 --> 44:27.940
What about you, Zhixia?

44:30.500 --> 44:32.030
Snakes are a bit dangerous.

44:32.420 --> 44:34.820
I've never touched a monkey before either.

44:35.500 --> 44:37.010
How big is that bird?

44:37.530 --> 44:38.300
Lin Zhixia.

44:41.980 --> 44:43.690
It's just a psychological test.

44:43.690 --> 44:45.090
No need to be so rigorous.

44:46.710 --> 44:47.630
Lin Zhixia.

44:47.980 --> 44:50.340
Just stick to your
final exams from now on.

44:50.340 --> 44:53.200
Stop participating
in these psychological tests.

44:53.690 --> 44:56.300
Okay, let me announce the final results.

44:59.170 --> 45:00.130
Actually,

45:00.300 --> 45:02.730
the monkey represents your partner.

45:04.820 --> 45:05.650
And the snake

45:05.730 --> 45:07.090
is your wealth.

45:08.650 --> 45:10.530
The bird represents your children.

45:10.530 --> 45:12.530
Think about how that applies to you.

45:13.380 --> 45:14.690
Look at me.

45:15.650 --> 45:18.820
I carry my partner on my shoulder.

45:19.170 --> 45:21.010
This is the forbearance

45:21.010 --> 45:22.460
and responsibility

45:22.460 --> 45:24.130
that a mature man

45:24.150 --> 45:25.690
and a true gentleman should have.

45:25.690 --> 45:26.380
Save it.

45:26.380 --> 45:28.570
Look at Jiang Yubai holding the monkey
in his arms.

45:28.570 --> 45:30.340
That's a caring man.

45:34.090 --> 45:35.550
It was just a casual reply.

45:35.780 --> 45:37.300
A caring man and a gentleman
are almost the same.

45:37.300 --> 45:38.610
Almost the same.

45:38.610 --> 45:40.670
Fortunately, I didn't say anything.

45:41.650 --> 45:43.510
We're holding the monkey's hand.

45:44.050 --> 45:45.780
There's nothing wrong with this answer.

45:45.780 --> 45:46.380
-Yes.
-It makes sense.

45:46.380 --> 45:47.260
It's normal.

45:49.570 --> 45:51.770
Why are we all talking about the monkey?

45:51.980 --> 45:53.240
We don't have the rest.

45:53.570 --> 45:55.300
You don't have a monkey either.

45:58.010 --> 45:58.940
We have nothing.

45:59.090 --> 46:00.210
-We have nothing.
-We have nothing.

46:00.210 --> 46:00.980
-We have nothing.
-We have nothing.

46:00.980 --> 46:02.780
-We have nothing.
-All nothing.

46:03.980 --> 46:04.670
That's right.

46:04.670 --> 46:05.840
Actually, just now,

46:05.840 --> 46:07.550
I just wanted to see our differences.

46:07.550 --> 46:08.500
It turns out you are all the same.

46:08.500 --> 46:09.690
Only Zhixia is different.

46:09.690 --> 46:11.110
-Zhixia.
-Yeah, it makes sense.

46:11.110 --> 46:11.800
Was it fun?

46:11.880 --> 46:13.080
It was a very fun test.

46:13.090 --> 46:15.070
Very fun.

46:15.070 --> 46:16.800
What's in this big jar of yours?

46:17.590 --> 46:18.150
Oh, that's fermented rice wine.

46:18.150 --> 46:19.360
My parents made it.

46:19.630 --> 46:20.960
It's delicious with glutinous rice balls

46:20.960 --> 46:21.840
and eggs.

46:24.480 --> 46:25.680
Fermented rice wine?

46:25.880 --> 46:27.460
It sounds delicious.

46:28.030 --> 46:29.710
Shall we...

46:34.180 --> 46:37.310
♪ Running and waiting for my exploration ♪

46:37.560 --> 46:40.580
♪ The unknown is so fascinating ♪

46:40.840 --> 46:43.130
♪ Young me stood on tiptoes ♪

46:43.550 --> 46:47.700
♪ Everything is transparent;
time is too light ♪

46:48.100 --> 46:51.260
♪ With my deduction,
the answer is clear in an instant ♪

46:51.490 --> 46:54.440
♪ The timer is still counting down
3, 2, 1 ♪

46:54.710 --> 46:57.320
♪ The best answer is within our reach ♪

46:57.520 --> 47:00.170
♪ How should I define ♪

47:00.530 --> 47:03.850
♪ Crossing the distance
between meridians and parallels ♪

47:14.110 --> 47:17.370
♪ With my deduction,
the answer is clear in an instant ♪

47:17.630 --> 47:20.560
♪ The timer is still counting down
3, 2, 1 ♪

47:20.790 --> 47:23.170
♪ The best answer is within our reach ♪

47:23.510 --> 47:26.130
♪ The destined miracle ♪

47:26.820 --> 47:31.540
♪ Crossing the distance
between meridians and parallels ♪

47:36.110 --> 47:37.190
In the new year,

47:37.190 --> 47:38.840
I hope we all

47:39.110 --> 47:40.550
succeed in our studies.

47:40.590 --> 47:42.320
Especially you, Tang.

47:42.800 --> 47:44.840
Hurry up and get into the top 50.

47:44.840 --> 47:45.510
Okay?

47:45.510 --> 47:47.320
We all hope so.

47:47.480 --> 47:48.960
Stop. I've made a wish.

47:48.960 --> 47:49.880
It won't work if you say more.

47:49.880 --> 47:52.150
All we can do now is wait

47:52.150 --> 47:53.150
and wish me well.

47:53.320 --> 47:54.280
Cheers!

47:54.320 --> 47:55.670
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

47:55.840 --> 47:57.280
Yes, cheers. Come on.

47:57.510 --> 47:58.110
Come on.

48:00.760 --> 48:01.690
Let me say a word.

48:02.590 --> 48:03.710
I hope in the new year,

48:03.710 --> 48:06.190
everyone can do what they want.

48:06.320 --> 48:08.400
Happiness is the most important!

48:08.400 --> 48:09.000
Cheers.

48:09.000 --> 48:10.190
Happiness for all.

48:10.320 --> 48:12.400
-Cheers.
-Happiness for all.

48:17.070 --> 48:21.670
Then I hope we can always be good friends.

48:22.150 --> 48:23.320
-Good friends.
-Well said, Zhixia.

48:23.320 --> 48:24.230
Let's drink to that.

48:24.230 --> 48:24.880
Nice.

48:24.920 --> 48:26.000
Well said, Zhixia.

48:44.000 --> 48:46.190
Then I hope that in the new year,

48:46.190 --> 48:48.960
everyone can go all out

48:50.000 --> 48:51.600
and get the grades they want.

48:52.190 --> 48:52.920
Cheers.

48:53.030 --> 48:54.090
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

48:54.110 --> 48:55.280
Go!

48:55.400 --> 48:56.040
Cheers!

48:56.060 --> 48:57.120
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

48:57.320 --> 48:58.190
Go!

49:05.480 --> 49:07.190
Then I won't talk about grades.

49:07.190 --> 49:08.990
I'll talk about something else.

49:09.110 --> 49:10.150
I hope...

49:12.110 --> 49:12.960
He doesn't like listening to you.

49:12.960 --> 49:13.760
What's wrong?

49:15.030 --> 49:17.590
He drank too much fermented rice wine!

49:18.230 --> 49:20.830
So Jiang Yubai has things
he's not good at, too.

49:20.840 --> 49:22.480
This doesn't look good.

49:22.840 --> 49:24.070
What should we do?

49:26.480 --> 49:28.230
How about letting him sleep here tonight?

49:28.230 --> 49:28.880
No.

49:36.800 --> 49:37.710
It's getting late.

49:37.710 --> 49:38.550
I'll take him back.

49:38.550 --> 49:39.800
Okay, you take him back.

49:39.800 --> 49:40.760
Zeqiu, help me.

49:40.760 --> 49:41.440
I'll help you.

49:41.440 --> 49:42.280
Come on, get up.

49:42.280 --> 49:42.960
No need, you sit.

49:42.960 --> 49:43.630
Sit well.

49:44.780 --> 49:46.400
Come on, let me pass.

49:46.840 --> 49:47.510
Careful.

49:49.000 --> 49:49.510
I got it.

49:49.840 --> 49:52.030
Take that suitcase with you.
That's his suitcase.

49:52.030 --> 49:54.030
He can come get it when he wakes up.

49:54.400 --> 49:55.190
No need, I can carry it.

49:55.190 --> 49:56.050
He can carry it.

49:57.110 --> 49:57.800
He's got it.

50:07.320 --> 50:08.110
Jiang Yubai.

50:10.190 --> 50:11.190
Stop pretending.

50:12.400 --> 50:13.800
I know you're not drunk.

50:31.710 --> 50:32.510
Jiang Yubai.

50:34.510 --> 50:36.970
Did you gain weight
during the winter break?

50:42.360 --> 50:43.110
Wake up!

50:49.800 --> 50:51.660
If you don't wake up, I'm leaving.

51:05.190 --> 51:06.320
You are so annoying!

52:19.230 --> 52:21.360
The living room was so small back then,

52:21.710 --> 52:23.760
but it held everyone's laughter.

52:25.380 --> 52:28.880
The sweetness of the fermented rice wine
seemed to still linger on our tongues,

52:28.880 --> 52:32.540
and the colors of the fireworks
were reflected in our tears of joy.

52:33.230 --> 52:35.000
I remember my friends and I

52:35.000 --> 52:37.360
listening to the lively TV programs,

52:38.000 --> 52:39.600
clinking glasses clumsily,

52:40.230 --> 52:43.420
and feeling the warmth
of the word "reunion."

52:45.590 --> 52:46.400
It turns out

52:47.130 --> 52:50.010
when the bonds of blood
aren't warm enough,

52:50.880 --> 52:54.150
Heaven still allows us
to choose our own family.

52:55.920 --> 52:57.180
That would be friends.

52:59.090 --> 53:00.950
We don't share the same last name,

53:01.110 --> 53:03.510
but we remember each other's preferences.

53:03.900 --> 53:05.820
We've seen each other at our worst

53:06.690 --> 53:08.620
and shared our brightest moments.

53:12.000 --> 53:13.460
The precious New Year mood

53:13.760 --> 53:15.760
is about guarding simple happiness

53:15.760 --> 53:17.290
with the family you choose.

53:19.190 --> 53:20.190
The glass is full.

53:20.960 --> 53:22.020
The glass is empty.

53:22.530 --> 53:24.590
I really want to raise my glass again,

53:24.730 --> 53:26.590
clink it gently against the void,

53:28.570 --> 53:29.780
and toast once more to

53:31.180 --> 53:33.170
the winter that made us a family.
